        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Square scarf. Mustard yellow border with white/red/blue geometric pattern (resembles profile of a face). Center section has scalloped edges and a light green background with a white foliate pattern. In each corner of the center section is a British landmark or a monument from the British Festival in 1951 that celebrated British technology and invention."@en ;
